1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,324
Ren: If you have a fever, check one thing
first.

2
00:00:03,994 --> 00:00:07,338
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
five of ten: 92 percent.

3
00:00:07,658 --> 00:00:10,606
Ren: Hour twenty. Noor burns with a fever.

4
00:00:11,276 --> 00:00:13,928
Ren: Pharmacy. Third door on the left.

5
00:00:14,598 --> 00:00:16,815
Ren: Listen first. Look second.

6
00:00:17,485 --> 00:00:20,993
Ren: Doctors. Three. Slow.

7
00:00:21,663 --> 00:00:22,399
Ren: One.

8
00:00:23,663 --> 00:00:24,225
Ren: Two.

9
00:00:25,663 --> 00:00:26,231
Ren: Three.

10
00:00:27,663 --> 00:00:30,615
Ren: Fridge door. Something is knocking.

11
00:00:31,285 --> 00:00:34,368
Gus: Ninety-two percent chance you will
open this door.

12
00:00:35,038 --> 00:00:40,233
Gus: I calculated every route out of here.
Yours is ninety-two percent death.

13
00:00:40,903 --> 00:00:44,040
Ren: Fever is not a bite. Check the skin
first.

14
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:45,784
Ren: I almost left her.

15
00:00:46,454 --> 00:00:50,773
Noor: It was only a fever. You almost ran.
I saw.

16
00:00:51,443 --> 00:00:55,834
Gus: Marlow will know you reached the
hospital. He always knows.

17
00:00:56,504 --> 00:00:58,180
Ren: One hundred forty-eight to go.

18
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:05,054
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part five of ten, The
Quiet Hand. Next: gus list. Follow for part six.

